{
    "name": "E2E Zoho Books - new invoice",
    "description": "Provokes the NewInvoice polling trigger: waits for the baseline tick, creates a customer and an invoice, asserts the invoice the trigger emits and deletes both.",
    "notes": {
        "a6092af9-2b2b-4e4a-8b96-324dd6117ec7": {
            "x": 64,
            "y": 512,
            "width": 672,
            "height": 272,
            "content": "## ⚠️ Test data assumption + timing\n\n**Organization ID** `20111141498` is set on the New Invoice trigger and on the Create/Delete components. It must be an organization of the connected Zoho Books account — on another tenant replace it in all four places (List Organizations returns it).\n\n**Do not remove the Wait.** New Invoice records the existing invoices on its first tick and only emits invoices created later; an invoice created at flow start lands in that baseline and never fires.\n\nThe cleanup lane reads the **trigger's** output (`invoice_id`, `customer_id`), so it doubles as the proof that the trigger fired. If the flow times out, delete the customer *Appmixer E2E customer …* and its invoice by hand."
        }
    },
